  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-11T22:39:16.665779Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T22:45:21.170051Z",
  "totalBlocks": 36,
  "translatedBlocks": 36,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a373cdee9027602d",
      "translationZh": "Language Technologies Lab 发布了 Visual Salamandra，在多模态人工智能领域迈出了重要一步，将 Salamandra 大语言模型（LLM）的能力扩展到图像和视频。Visual Salamandra 基于拥有 70 亿参数的基础模型，在保持其紧凑性和效率的同时，将其扩展至多模态任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e280272c46363bb",
      "translationZh": "Visual Salamandra 的设计以视觉与语言对齐为核心，在 Salamandra Instructed 7B 模型的基础上，集成了 Google 的 SigLIP 编码器（SigLIP-So400m）、一个 2 层 MLP 投影器以及先进的后期融合技术，以弥合视觉模态与文本模态之间的鸿沟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "040af259049fc1d1",
      "translationZh": "由此形成的架构使 Visual Salamandra 能够理解多种输入，并生成符合上下文的准确回答，输入范围涵盖单张和多张图像、视频，以及纯文本指令。这一进展体现了该实验室更广泛的承诺：支持稳健、多语言和多模态的 AI 系统，尤其是优先重视欧洲语言多样性的系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "382597fd589b73d4",
      "translationZh": "训练 Visual Salamandra：深入探索视觉实验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a30232be00a8dba",
      "translationZh": "为使 Salamandra 适应视觉输入，该实验室实施了以后期融合架构为核心的四阶段训练流程。在这一配置中，预训练图像编码器（SigLIP，384x384 分辨率下的 14 个图像块）生成图像嵌入，随后通过经过专门训练的多层感知机（MLP）投影器，将这些嵌入与 LLM 对齐。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9ec29932b7d96b6",
      "translationZh": "四个训练阶段包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb430fd51e667bc4",
      "translationZh": "• 阶段 1：投影器预训练——仅训练投影器，将图像特征映射到 LLM 的潜在空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ebe0dcc4885196b",
      "translationZh": "• 阶段 2：高质量视觉预训练——使用经过精加工的数据集（例如 OCR 和重新生成描述的图像），对整个架构（编码器、投影器和 LLM）进行联合训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f99ce7c0f79ede0",
      "translationZh": "• 阶段 3：指令微调——模型通过视觉问答（VQA）、OCR 以及其他基于视觉信息的任务，学习遵循用户指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80d698e577a19485",
      "translationZh": "• 阶段 4：全面多模态微调——纳入单图像、多图像和视频数据，以及纯文本样例，以优化模型在真实世界多输入场景中的泛化能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e78ee471e5c73c0",
      "translationZh": "数据多样性在整个训练过程中发挥了关键作用。共使用了 6.1 百万个指令微调实例，其中包括 842,000 个纯文本样本。训练语料包含来自 AI2D、Cambrian 和 LLaVA Next 等来源的数据，选择这些数据旨在增强视觉定位、文档理解、数学推理和 OCR 能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93a1ceacda63ef40",
      "translationZh": "图 1. Visual Salamandra 7B 训练过程中的数据分布",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dd6eda3708ca85e5",
      "translationZh": "多语言数据与欧洲语言的覆盖",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25003a8f52f12b4f",
      "translationZh": "与 Language Technologies Lab 此前推出的模型一样，Visual Salamandra 延续了对多语言包容性的承诺，并重点关注欧洲语言。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abe4dcf036f951c5",
      "translationZh": "这一方法确保代表性不足的语言能够受益于指令微调及与视觉任务的对齐，有助于缩小多模态 AI 研究中的资源差距。Visual Salamandra 是同类模型中首批将这种语言多样性融入多模态指令微调框架的模型之一。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "736bfa4b16e34eca",
      "translationZh": "图 2. 使用 Text Regularization 训练并与原始骨干 LLM 合并的模型所生成的多语言示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a99bd6cdc96b9bbe",
      "translationZh": "应用与未来方向",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e37a5101a9abfe9",
      "translationZh": "Visual Salamandra 为语言与视觉交叉领域的广泛应用开辟了可能，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efea58d1f08d0f39",
      "translationZh": "• 视觉问答（VQA）：针对图像或视频提出问题，并获得能够理解上下文的准确回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6c7fb5ab29b60c4",
      "translationZh": "• 光学字符识别（OCR）：准确读取并转录文档、场景和图表中的文字。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c2b70630e7f4354",
      "translationZh": "• 文档与图表理解：分析复杂的视觉文档或包含嵌入文字的图形内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d4e95bb96657097",
      "translationZh": "• 数学推理：通过多模态推理解决基于视觉信息的数学问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "708093a4bc8562ef",
      "translationZh": "• 基于指令的图像交互：在视觉情境中遵循详细指令，包括图像描述和定位任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1be436c1ff57bb3f",
      "translationZh": "视频能力的加入也为视频摘要、事件检测和多模态叙事等方面的进一步发展打开了大门……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7dfa234a471bbab",
      "translationZh": "通过 Visual Salamandra，语言技术实验室展现了其在构建具有包容性、高性能的基础模型方面持续保持的领先地位。通过将最先进的视觉编码器与强大的多语言大语言模型相融合，该团队正为能够跨模态、跨语言进行感知、理解和交流的下一代 AI 系统奠定基础。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fb5a18a7aac50b68",
      "translationZh": "伦理问题与局限性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "538d62ee0d0c7dcb",
      "translationZh": "虽然 Visual Salamandra 展现出了强大的多模态能力，但仍需注意其局限性：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02d1f1a0362fdc9d",
      "translationZh": "• 它可能因幻觉而生成看似合理但实际错误的答案，尤其是在视觉输入含糊不清时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66ff4063b4e8ebd2",
      "translationZh": "• 在复杂 OCR 和密集文档版式上的表现仍面临挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc83b7cc89bd0fec",
      "translationZh": "• 该模型使用经过筛选且获得许可的数据集进行训练，但用户仍应警惕潜在的偏见或不准确之处，尤其是在将其部署于敏感应用场景时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51f38254dbb0720c",
      "translationZh": "我们建议在能够进行人工监督的场景中使用 Visual Salamandra，并避免在未经适当评估的情况下将其用于高风险应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4518da522bff7453",
      "translationZh": "Visual Salamandra 依据 Apache License, Version 2.0 发布，允许用于研究和非商业用途。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a13c8fca67f0121",
      "translationZh": "敬请关注未来发布的版本以及基于 Visual Salamandra 构建的工具，并在我们的论文中了解完整的模型细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5964b4793c907b90",
      "translationZh": "语言技术实验室团队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "791552fd3a59d035",
      "translationZh": "致谢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0a1dd25e5d17cf0",
      "translationZh": "本研究在 Modelos del Lenguaje 项目框架下，获得了数字化转型与公共职能部以及复苏、转型与韧性计划的支持和资助；该计划由欧盟通过 NextGenerationEU 提供资金。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
